created: undefined, last updated: 2026-06-14, [Read more](https://www.apideck.com/issue-tracking-api/collection-tags)

# Issue Tracking Tags API
One unified API to sync tags across all major issue tracking platforms.
Build once, integrate everywhere.
Get started for freeAPI Reference
## Unified Tags Operations
Standard CRUD operations normalized across all platforms
ListGET
`/collection-tags`
Retrieve all tags with pagination and filtering
GetGET
`/collection-tags/{id}`
Fetch a single tag by ID
CreatePOST
`/collection-tags`
Create a new tag
UpdatePATCH
`/collection-tags/{id}`
Update an existing tag
## Quick Start
...
import { Apideck } from '@apideck/node'
const apideck = new Apideck({
apiKey: 'YOUR_API_KEY',
appId: 'YOUR_APP_ID',
consumerId: 'user-123'
})
// List tags from any connected issue tracking platform
const response = await apideck.issue-tracking.collectiontagsAll()
// Returns normalized data regardless of the underlying platform
console.log(response.data)
// [
// { id: '123', ...
},
// { id: '456', ...
}
// ]
// Works the same for Xero, QuickBooks, NetSuite, etc.

